{"id": "3281229", "name": "compute directional derivative - גרסה מעוצבת", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">חישוב נגזרת כיוונית</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\">נתונה הפונקציה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f:\\mathbb{R}^{{CT:0}}\\to\\mathbb{R}\\)</span></p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px 12px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f={{CT:1}}\\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 10px 0 6px 0;\">נחשב את הנגזרת הכיוונית של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span> בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P={{CT:2}}\\)</span> בכיוון הווקטור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v={{CT:3}}\\)</span>.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0 0; color: #665f6b; font-size: 14px;\">שימו לב: הווקטור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\)</span> אינו בהכרח וקטור יחידה.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">א</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">וקטור היחידה בכיוון הנתון</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 12px 0;\">מצאו את וקטור היחידה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\widehat v\\)</span> בכיוון של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\)</span>.</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\widehat v=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">ב</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">הגרדיאנט בנקודה</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 12px 0;\">חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\nabla f(P)\\)</span>.</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\nabla f(P)=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; background: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">ג</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">הנגזרת הכיוונית</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 6px 0;\">חשבו את הנגזרת הכיוונית של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span> בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P\\)</span> בכיוון <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\)</span>.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: #665f6b; font-size: 14px;\"><strong>רמז:</strong> האם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span> דיפרנציאבילית בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P\\)</span>?</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f'_v(P)=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right; line-height: 1.75; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; color: #1f2937;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">ראשית מנרמלים את וקטור הכיוון:</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0; line-height: 1.9;\">\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle \\|v\\|={{CT:4}}\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle \\widehat v=\\frac{v}{\\|v\\|}={{CT:5}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">כעת מחשבים את הגרדיאנט:</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0; line-height: 1.9;\">\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle \\nabla f={{CT:6}}\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle \\nabla f\\left({{CT:2}}\\right)={{CT:7}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">לבסוף משתמשים במכפלה הסקלרית:</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 0 0; line-height: 1.9;\">\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle f'_v(P)=\\nabla f(P)\\cdot\\widehat v\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle f'_v(P)={{CT:8}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt2]] [[feedback:prt3]] [[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 22, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt2", "value": 0.25, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "tans2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">נכון. וקטור הכיוון נורמל כראוי.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">וקטור היחידה אינו נכון. חלקו את הווקטור הנתון באורך שלו.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 0.3, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "tans3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">נכון. הגרדיאנט בנקודה חושב כראוי.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">הגרדיאנט אינו נכון. חשבו את כל הנגזרות החלקיות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span> ולאחר מכן הציבו את הנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "Result", "value": 0.45, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>נכון.</strong> הנגזרת הכיוונית חושבה כראוי.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">התוצאה הסופית אינה נכונה. חשבו את המכפלה הסקלרית של הגרדיאנט בנקודה עם וקטור היחידה בכיוון הנתון.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["Ptuple", "a", "b", "c", "d", "dval", "func", "func2", "func3", "gradP", "gradexprtuple", "gradtuple", "gxP", "gxexpr", "gyP", "gyexpr", "gzP", "gzexpr", "n", "tans1", "tans2", "tans3", "unitlist", "unittuple", "unitv", "vlist", "vlist2", "vlist3", "vnorm", "vtuple", "vx", "vy", "vz", "x0", "y0", "z0"], "nvariants": 50}